<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"></view><view class="topbar"><view class="back" bindtap="back"><image class="figma-back" src="/assets/figma/all/s19-imgFrame.svg"/></view><view class="top-title-main top-title">虫种详情</view><view class="top-action" bindtap="compare">加入对比</view></view>
<view class="species-hero"><image class="species-hero-bg" src="/assets/figma/all/s19-imgFrame1.svg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="chip">疑似候选</view><image class="hero-tick" src="/assets/figma/all/s19-imgFrame2.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="species-name"><view class="h2">中华硬蜱</view><view class="tiny">Ixodes sinensis · 附着类参考</view></view></view><view class="notice" style="margin-top:28rpx;text-align:center;justify-content:center">外形和环境信息仅供对照，不构成虫种确诊</view>
<view class="section-title">关键特征</view><view class="stack gap-12"><view wx:for="{{features}}" wx:key="n" class="field"><view class="circle circle-green" style="width:56rpx;height:56rpx">{{item.n}}</view><view class="grow" style="margin-left:22rpx">{{item.t}}</view><text class="muted">{{item.d}}</text></view></view>
<view class="section-title">常见环境</view><view class="chip-row"><view class="chip active">草地</view><view class="chip active">灌木</view><view class="chip">动物活动区</view><view class="chip active">春夏秋</view></view><view class="detail-actions"><button class="secondary-btn" bindtap="compare">加入对比</button><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="danger">发生接触，安全判断</button></view><view class="safe-note" style="margin-top:24rpx">不要仅依据图片自行移除附着物</view></view>
